# ------------------------------------------------------------
# WHAT IS TRACKED ON GITHUB ✅
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# ✅ notebooks/*.ipynb        (all Jupyter notebooks)
# ✅ results/*.png            (visualization images)
# ✅ results/*.json           (training stats)
# ✅ data/indian_reviews/indian_reviews_dataset.csv
# ✅ data/indian_reviews/annotation_guidelines.md
# ✅ data/**/.gitkeep         (folder placeholders)
# ✅ data/README.md           (dataset documentation)
# ✅ PROGRESS_LOG.md          (project progress)
# ✅ README.md                (project overview)
# ✅ requirements.txt         (dependencies)
# ✅ .gitignore               (this file)
# ✅ LICENSE                  (license file)
